        "text": "[返回农场与巴里] 我再想想。",
        "topic": "TALK_TRAVEL_MAYA_MENU_FARM"
      },
      {
        "text": "[返回主菜单] 先谈别的。",
        "topic": "TALK_TRAVEL_MAYA_ISHERWOOD"
      }
    ]
  },
